WEBVTT

18:30.302 --> 18:33.555
They were killed
on the orders of King Aerys, yes.

18:33.681 --> 18:37.893
- The Mad King.
- Commonly known as the Mad King.

18:38.727 --> 18:40.729
Why were they killed?

18:41.605 --> 18:44.316
You should speak to your father
about these matters.

18:44.441 --> 18:46.568
I don't want to speak
to my father, ever.

18:46.694 --> 18:49.822
Sansa, you will
find it in your heart

18:49.947 --> 18:53.575
- to forgive your father.
- No, I won't.

18:54.368 --> 18:57.079
MAN: It's the Hand's Tournament
that's causing all this trouble, my lords.

18:57.204 --> 19:02.418
The King's Tournament.
I assure you the Hand wants no part of it.
